{"id":"vod_sn_37348","vodId":"37348","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Ange Vierge","name_cn":"Ange Vierge","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a281eff38db9911a779a41d7c7d1f869.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个架空的世界之中，这里被分为五个部分，人类所居住的地球、诸神的红色世界、理性与科学统治的白色世界、充满了魔法的黑色世界以及崇尚武力和战争的绿色世界。长久以来，五个世界相互制约抗衡，形成了微妙的平衡，然而一场意外的发生让这五个世界都将面临着同一个结局——毁灭。　　为了避免这恐怖的未来图景成为现实，拥有“Excceed能力”的少女们挺身而出，她们被送往名为青兰学院的学校之中，在这里接受训练和保护。率真耿直的彩城天音（田村由加莉 配音）、沉默寡言的苍月纱夜（寿美菜子 配音）、优雅高贵的阿尔玛利亚（原由实 配音），在校园里，这些命运相似的少女们相遇了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UCFJTqpq8B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0LUR2Z1KML1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j4bMk9t1DD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q4B5NCthWt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SNLKGAZDqm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LQvddZk2n61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VbYXAgENnz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VgWpdCSnYD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vvFTQaCMJJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JYJf0pj9Uv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WC4w2gz9VT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kKiX7xn84y1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:11.930Z"}